{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J5MhkIdlNS1793592081.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國得州達拉斯一個娛樂區短時間內發生3宗槍擊案，至少4死15傷。</p><p></p><p>警方稱該娛樂區由當地星期日凌晨零時20分起，75分鐘內發生3宗槍擊案。據報在其中一個案發現場，一名男子開槍前揚言自己準備開火。警方指，該處多人中槍，其中3人當場死亡。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pt67G0Dnx61793570803.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>第二個案發位置有1人喪生。案發的娛樂區商店及食肆林立，事發時不少人在慶祝萬聖節前夕。有目擊者形容現場一片混亂。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265wq4bciwtp1793570801.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方就事故展開調查，包括犯案動機，至今有1人被捕，另外有1人被追緝，暫時未知3宗槍擊案是否有關連。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:20.447443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:38:56.049559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:58:07.739012+00:00","content_hash":"3158fabbb2b756cfb9f7741ba7da3d564cfd73c9dde2fd0a600cc5c5c7c87fea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:20.447443+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}